son":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"两个 Counter 由两次 new 得到。first.count = 6 后，second.count 保持多少？","result":"若没有别的赋值，它保持默认的 0。改写发生在 first 指向的对象上。"},{"id":"java.example.5fb3e16fabaafd184b3f","lessonId":"java.lesson.5fb3e16fabaafd184b3f","status":"reading-only","reason":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"class Ticket { static int issued; int serial; } 哪个字段适合记录总出票量？","result":"issued 是类级共享字段。serial 属于各张票，用于保存每张票的编号。"},{"id":"java.example.ef1bde4baf186b53e962","lessonId":"java.lesson.ef1bde4baf186b53e962","status":"reading-only","reason":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"Door d = new Door(); d.total 可改为怎样的清晰写法？","result":"若 total 是公开的静态字段，写 Door.total。读者由名字即可辨认归属。"},{"id":"java.example.62a3a6594bbf36d3a593","lessonId":"java.lesson.62a3a6594bbf36d3a593","status":"reading-only","reason":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"counter = null; 后能否认为 Counter.total 已经归零？","result":"不能。counter 的绑定改变不影响 Counter 类字段。"},{"id":"java.example.d240f99dffb081b5df75","lessonId":"java.lesson.d240f99dffb081b5df75","status":"reading-only","reason":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"在普通静态初始化中先写 total = 3; 再写 capacity = total + 2;，capacity 的值是什么？","result":"为 5。第二项读取了已按顺序写入的 total。"},{"id":"java.example.cc1eb8902a6b2f8b4a8d","lessonId":"java.lesson.cc1eb8902a6b2f8b4a8d","status":"reading-only","reason":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"static int limit 与 static final int LIMIT 的赋值能力有何不同？","result":"limit 在访问允许时可继续赋值；LIMIT 初始化后不允许重新赋值。"},{"id":"java.example.d23d4bd323088383346b","lessonId":"java.lesson.d23d4bd323088383346b","status":"reading-only","reason":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"要禁止调用方把缓存容量写成负数，直接 public static 暴露好还是用校验方法？","result":"用私有字段配合校验方法。入口可以统一拒绝负值并维护状态。"},{"id":"java.example.44d8d218b7ab2e81a24d","lessonId":"java.lesson.44d8d218b7ab2e81a24d","status":"reading-only","reason":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"两个线程都从 count=8 读值再分别写回 9，正确累计应该是多少？","result":"两次成功增加应为 10。交错的读改写只写出了 9，因此需要协调。"},{"id":"java.example.79757557a376d7566323","lessonId":"java.lesson.79757557a376d7566323","status":"reading-only","reason":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"可修改的全局计数器用 TOTAL_COUNT 是否容易误导？","result":"容易。totalCount 更符合可修改字段的语义，声明中的 static 表示共享。"},{"id":"java.example.c4273796b57a349f1ec5","lessonId":"java.lesson.c4273796b57a349f1ec5","status":"reading-only","reason":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"预约对象有 startTime，所有预约统一限制 MAX_SLOTS。两者各放哪里？","result":"startTime 属于每个预约；不可变的 MAX_SLOTS 可用类级常量表示。"},{"id":"java.example.0a5f58dc16f56cf37161","lessonId":"java.lesson.0a5f58dc16f56cf37161","status":"reading-only","reason":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"从 issued=0 起创建两张票。两张票的 serial 与最终 issued 分别是多少？","result":"第一张 1，第二张 2，issued 为 2。再读第一张仍为 1。"}],"activities":[{"id":"java.check.b81f85339f7d646e40f9","lessonId":"java.lesson.b81f85339f7d646e40f9","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"java.example.b81f85339f7d646e40f9","prompt":"void add(int n) { n++; } 接收 x=4。调用后 x 的值是什么？","reveal":"仍是 4。方法内写入的是参数 n，不是调用方变量 x。"},{"id":"java.check.ad93b88334d9b6587f42","lessonId":"java.lesson.ad93b88334d9b6587f42","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"java.example.ad93b88334d9b6587f42","prompt":"{ int step = 3; } 后紧接 System.out.println(step);，能读到 step 吗？","reveal":"不能。右大括号已经结束 step 的作用域，打印语句引用不到它。"},{"id":"java.check.672ae330290824982406","lessonId":"java.lesson.672ae330290824982406","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"java.example.672ae330290824982406","prompt":"两个 Counter 由两次 new 得到。first.count = 6 后，second.count 保持多少？","reveal":"若没有别的赋值，它保持默认的 0。改写发生在 first 指向的对象上。"},{"id":"java.check.5fb3e16fabaafd184b3f","lessonId":"java.lesson.5fb3e16fabaafd184b3f","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"java.example.5fb3e16fabaafd184b3f","prompt":"class Ticket { static int issued; int serial; } 哪个字段适合记录总出票量？","reveal":"issued 是类级共享字段。serial 属于各张票，用于保存每张票的编号。"},{"id":"java.check.ef1bde4baf186b53e962","lessonId":"java.lesson.ef1bde4baf186b53e962","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"java.example.ef1bde4baf186b53e962","prompt":"Door d = new Door(); d.total 可改为怎样的清晰写法？","reveal":"若 total 是公开的静态字段，写 Door.total。读者由名字即可辨认归属。"},{"id":"java.check.62a3a6594bbf36d3a593","l